WEBVTT

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:37.999
[Music]

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.999
[Singing]

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.999
[Singing]

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.999
[Singing]

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.999
[Singing]

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:50.999
[Music]

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:51.999
Ah.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:52.999
Hey.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.999
Like this...

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:57.999
We're really sorry we're late.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.999
We had a good reason,

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.999
but we won't tell you.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:02.999
Ja...

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.999
Ja... Our five-member live is back.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:05.999
Five-member live!

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.999
Bang, bang, bang! [Laughs]

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.999
Bang, bang!

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.999
Ja... Let's sit down.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:14.999
We should take our seats. Yes.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:15.999
And who are we? [Laughs]

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.999
We're PLAVE.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.999
Here to give you energy!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:24.999
This is already so much fun.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.999
Just a little more.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.999
You'll catch a cold.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:30.999
A little more.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:33.999
Please come closer.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:34.999
Thank you.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.999
You're working hard.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:39.999
My energy is no joke.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:40.999
You missed seeing us together.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.999
Thank you so much.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:43.999
Some people may be seeing us

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.999
for the first time.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:46.999
I'm sure there are some.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.999
Let's do our group greeting.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:49.999
Our leader can lead us.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:50.999
Go ahead.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.999
I'm the leader? All right.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.999
Hello, everyone. We are

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.999
PLAVE!

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.999
Ja... I'm Nam Yejun.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.999
Yes.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.999
And I'm Nam Mijun.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.999
I fell from the number-one husband candidate

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:13.999
to number five.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.999
Honey.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.999
[Laughs]

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:18.999
Ja... Great.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:19.999
Ja... Next, who is Han Noah?

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.999
Where did Han Noah go?

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.999
Who is Han Noah?

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:24.999
Hello.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:26.999
Yes, I'm Boss Han Noah.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:27.999
Oh, you're Han Noah.

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.999
Comedy is about repetition. [Laughs]

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.999
Yes, repetition.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.999
But only repeat it twice.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:35.999
Even repetition gets tiresome

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.999
if you take it to round three.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.999
Speaking of the one responsible for that...

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.999
It's our first five-member live in ages.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.999
There may be new viewers,

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.999
so let's introduce ourselves.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:48.999
Hello. First...

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.999
Uh...

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:56.999
I'm PLAVE's CWK. Honey, have you eaten?

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:57.999
I'm sorry. [Snorts]

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.999
Hey!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.999
Do it properly. “Honey, have you

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:02.999
eaten?”

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.999
“Honey, have you eaten?”

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.999
That's how you use the skill?

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:07.999
Do it properly.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.999
How? Show us, Bamby.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:13.999
If you won't do it, try it.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:14.999
Bamby, show us once.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.999
Hello, I'm CWK. Honey, have you

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:19.999
eaten?

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:20.999
That's how it's done.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:23.999
Bamby's been off his game lately.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:25.999
He really has.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:26.999
I practically had it.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:27.999
Then who am I supposed to be?

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.999
Nobody's left.

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.999
CEO William. Should I be the CEO?

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.999
All right.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:35.999
Anyway... [Clears throat]

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.999
You're all laughing,

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.999
so I think you know who's who.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.999
Right. You can't not know us.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.999
It was Operation Fool PLLI,

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:46.999
but no one's fooled—only fooling.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.999
Some people are fooled.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:51.999
Right from the start...

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.999
Shall we begin properly?

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.999
Shall we get the broadcast going properly?

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.999
Bamby is still the MC, right?

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.999
Right. But why is Hamin...

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:00.999
doing this now?
I was only asking.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.999
No, I just...

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:03.999
It's already been handed over now.

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.999
What happened with the MC role?

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.999
Did we choose who's next?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:08.999
Did we?

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:09.999
Not yet.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.999
What are you trying to say?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.999
What are you saying?

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.999
Ja... It's gone now.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.999
What? Ja... His mind went blank.

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.999
This tests his MC skills.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:22.999
Let's see.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:24.999
Ja... Everyone, in this sweltering heat...

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:27.999
as you love and support us...

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.999
I have something to say.

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:32.999
[Clears throat]

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:33.999
As you can tell from our outfits,

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.999
we came here

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.999
Ja... to blow away PLLI's heat

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.999
Ja... and cool you down.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:42.999
That's why we're here.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:45.999
Let's make an acrostic with “heat.”

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:46.999
[Shouts]

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.999
Wi...

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.999
Great...

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.999
I can't carry on the great PLLI.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.999
Ah...

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:56.999
I think I'm losing it today.

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:57.999
Seriously.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.999
Your skills are lacking.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.999
Ja... Make an acrostic with “skill.”

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:06.999
Ja... Qual...

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:09.999
Then show us an example.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.999
[Laughs] It's not easy.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.999
Right, demonstrate it.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:14.999
Give us anything.

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.999
“Skill” is too hard.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.999
Something unexpected.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:19.999
Unexpected.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:20.999
Anything.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.999
I'll go with “imagination.”

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:30.999
Ja... Only the first syllable remains. Macho man!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:31.999
We need to do that again.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.999
Hurry—repeat it now.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:35.999
Today...

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:36.999
Are you going running?

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.999
Are you? [Laughs]

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.999
Will you promise PLLI

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:41.999
whether you'll run today?

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:44.999
I really have to today.

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.999
Ja... That 100-calorie curry...

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:48.999
I really want to add ramen and eat it.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:49.999
I've been craving it.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:50.999
I feel like I'm dreaming right now.

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:52.999
Seriously, where am I

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:53.999
right now?

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:54.999
Ja... But yesterday...

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.999
Go ahead.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.999
Ja... Eunho, are you promising

00:11:59.000 --> 00:11:59.999
to run today?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.999
In this tropical-night heat?

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:02.999
Yes, I'm running.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:05.999
If you break another promise,

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.999
PLLI can't trust Eunho anymore.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:08.999
Mm.

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:10.999
I'll really run. Yes.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:11.999
Today.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:13.999
Running... Hamin,

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.999
if you put ramen in 100-calorie curry

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:16.999
and eat it...

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:17.999
Just try it once.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:18.999
I'll run—but what even is that?

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:19.999
What is it?

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.999
I don't know either.

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.999
Drain the ramen

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:24.999
and pour the curry on top.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:27.999
That's how you eat it.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:28.999
Like curry fried noodles?

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.999
I don't know why either.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:31.999
Why not?

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:33.999
It just happened.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:34.999
Like that.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.999
Great.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:39.999
Are you pushing this on him? [Laughs]

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:40.999
Just pushing it.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:41.999
Pushing.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:42.999
No matter what.

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:43.999
Understood.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:45.999
Ja... Great. Ja... Everyone...

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:48.999
This heat wave is intense.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.999
Both on Terra

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.999
and in Asterum, it's incredibly hot.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.999
Please be careful

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.999
and drink lots of water.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.999
It's dangerously hot lately.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.999
So drink water often.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.999
PLAVE should too.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.999
Shall we have a glass?

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.999
Let's drink.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:09.999
Okay, okay.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.999
Ja... Shall we have a drink?

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.999
Ja... Everyone has water, right?

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.999
Cheers!

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:17.999
Be careful of the heat.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:19.999
Please take care.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:21.999
Mm.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:24.999
I think it reached 39°C today.

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:25.999
Thirty-nine degrees is...

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.999
It really feels...

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.999
If your body temperature reaches 39 degrees Celsius...

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.999
Not the feels-like temperature—

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:33.999
it actually reached 39°C.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:34.999
Thirty-nine today...

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.999
Ja... A mild fever is 37°C.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.999
At 39°C, you should go to the ER.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:40.999
You really should. I've hit 39°C before.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.999
Yes, 39°C.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:43.999
My fever went up that high.

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:46.999
I tried to endure it, then went to the ER.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.999
Why would you endure that?

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:49.999
Please don't try to endure it.

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:51.999
Ja, ja, ja... Everyone.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:52.999
That's that.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:53.999
[Clears throat] Do you each have

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:54.999
a way to beat the heat?

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.999
Let's share some with PLLI.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:59.999
Fight heat with heat.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.999
When it's hot, answer with something hot.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.999
That's why we ate hotter food.

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:04.999
Nakgopsae.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:05.999
You're fighting hard.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:06.999
Nakgopsae. Hyung...

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:07.999
Where did you go after ordering it?

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:11.999
I had a personal schedule.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:12.999
A personal schedule?

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:13.999
Yes, I had somewhere to be.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:14.999
So...

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.999
Anyway, was it good?

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.999
We ordered nakgopsae today,

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.999
then he left briefly for his schedule.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.999
It arrived while he was gone,

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.999
so Bamby and I ate it together.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:26.999
I'll be honest.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:27.999
Compared with the one I ordered before...

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:29.999
No, I know. Let me guess from your eyes.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.999
Earlier, Nam Yejun's expression

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:32.999
didn't look that pleased.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.999
You heard about it, hyung.
I didn't.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:35.999
Really?

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.999
We kept saying it was bad

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:39.999
but forced ourselves to eat it. Good thing you left.

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.999
Really? It wasn't good.

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:42.999
It was seriously bad.

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:44.999
I had one delivered before, remember?

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:45.999
Yeah.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:46.999
How did it compare?

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:48.999
Yours was much better.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:51.999
Much better. Today's was...

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:52.999
How should I put it? What was wrong?

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:53.999
The nakgopsae?

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:54.999
It tasted watery.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:55.999
It was bland.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.999
Bland.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:58.999
It wasn't spicy.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.999
Not spicy at all.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:02.999
Just bland.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:03.999
Yes.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.999
Something was off.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:06.999
[Laughs] It smelled good, though.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.999
I was uneasy. I need to inspect

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.999
the food photos first,

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:12.999
but you ordered without my review.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:15.999
You should get approval first.

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.999
I review everything—

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.999
the broth's thickness and all that.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.999
You read the reviews?

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:22.999
Yes, I inspect it all.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.999
Everything.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:25.999
That's how you should do it.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.999
Exactly. Reviews tell you things.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:30.999
Don't just look at the score.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:33.999
Check the thickness and how well it's cooked.

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:35.999
You really need to read reviews.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:39.999
If I'd seen it...

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:40.999
I wouldn't have approved it.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.999
But it did arrive properly.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:44.999
Yes.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:45.999
No, no.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.999
Why do you keep staring? Look away.

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:49.999
You should look at your fellow member.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:50.999
[Laughs]

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.999
Staring like that is a little...

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:55.999
Hamin, we had a great time

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:56.999
together.

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:57.999
Again?

00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:59.999
Another one of my

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:00.999
favorite restaurants.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.999
He grabbed my wrist that day

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:05.999
and dragged me along.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:06.999
He said to trust him and follow.

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:07.999
“Don't ask questions.”

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.999
“Just follow me.”

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:10.999
So we went.

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:12.999
What did you eat? Something like samgyeopsal?

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:13.999
I didn't even know. I just sat down.

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:15.999
He said he'd order everything.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.999
He wouldn't tell me what.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:18.999
Now I won't do it.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:19.999
But when the food came...

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.999
Yes.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:22.999
It was the best.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.999
I couldn't even open my bowl of rice.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:26.999
Right.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.999
Was that pork belly? I still

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:30.999
don't know. Gabrisal.

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:32.999
Apparently it was gabrisal.

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:33.999
So you went to Bulri.

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:34.999
Gabrisal.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:35.999
Isn't gabrisal

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.999
really fatty?

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:39.999
No, that's a different cut.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.999
Not that one.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:42.999
Oh, a different one.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:45.999
They greased the griddle lid

