00:57:25.000 --> 00:57:25.999
I only uploaded one with isolated vocals.

00:57:26.000 --> 00:57:27.999
Hyung, do you know what you spoiled?

00:57:28.000 --> 00:57:29.999
I do.

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:30.999
What was it? [Laughs]

00:57:31.000 --> 00:57:31.999
That...

00:57:32.000 --> 00:57:33.999
Apparently I spoiled something too.

00:57:34.000 --> 00:57:34.999
I didn't even realize.

00:57:35.000 --> 00:57:35.999
I gave a spoiler.

00:57:36.000 --> 00:57:36.999
You did.

00:57:37.000 --> 00:57:39.999
I didn't know, but my voice was in it too,

00:57:40.000 --> 00:57:42.999
right, hyung?

00:57:43.000 --> 00:57:44.999
Right. I remember. Bamby's part.

00:57:45.000 --> 00:57:45.999
“Matdamyeon...”

00:57:46.000 --> 00:57:46.999
That's right.

00:57:47.000 --> 00:57:48.999
Right, that one.

00:57:49.000 --> 00:57:51.999
While watching Bubble, it kept repeating.

00:57:52.000 --> 00:57:52.999
“Matdamyeon.” What got hit?

00:57:53.000 --> 00:57:54.999
Where did it hit me? [Laughs]

00:57:55.000 --> 00:57:56.999
I didn't know, but when I checked,

00:57:57.000 --> 00:57:58.999
it turned out hyung had done that.

00:57:59.000 --> 00:57:59.999
What did Eunho do?

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:01.999
“Matdamyeon.”

00:58:02.000 --> 00:58:04.999
[They try to recall Eunho's lyric.]

00:58:05.000 --> 00:58:06.999
[They continue recalling it.]

00:58:07.000 --> 00:58:09.999
I think that's right.

00:58:10.000 --> 00:58:11.999
PLLI are posting the lyric in the comments.

00:58:12.000 --> 00:58:12.999
[They quote the lyric.]

00:58:13.000 --> 00:58:13.999
It's from one of our songs.

00:58:14.000 --> 00:58:14.999
What was it?

00:58:15.000 --> 00:58:19.999
[They recall a song lyric]

00:58:20.000 --> 00:58:22.999
[They quote the lyric]

00:58:23.000 --> 00:58:25.999
[They continue quoting the lyric]

00:58:26.000 --> 00:58:27.999
[Singing]

00:58:28.000 --> 00:58:29.999
Ah.

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:32.999
So hyung revealed that part.

00:58:33.000 --> 00:58:33.999
Right.

00:58:34.000 --> 00:58:34.999
Ah.

00:58:35.000 --> 00:58:35.999
Of course—that lyric.

00:58:36.000 --> 00:58:38.999
So all of it was revealed.

00:58:39.000 --> 00:58:39.999
Ah.

00:58:40.000 --> 00:58:41.999
Right.

00:58:42.000 --> 00:58:42.999
Yes.

00:58:43.000 --> 00:58:44.999
That's a huge spoiler. [Laughs]

00:58:45.000 --> 00:58:45.999
Right.

00:58:46.000 --> 00:58:49.999
Mm.

00:58:50.000 --> 00:58:50.999
Did you sing that part?

00:58:51.000 --> 00:58:51.999
What?

00:58:52.000 --> 00:58:53.999
Yes.

00:58:54.000 --> 00:58:55.999
I see.

00:58:56.000 --> 00:58:56.999
Really?

00:58:57.000 --> 00:58:58.999
Apparently I sang it.

00:58:59.000 --> 00:58:59.999
[They make another lyric reference]

00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:01.999
Ja... How do we transition from here?

00:59:02.000 --> 00:59:03.999
How should the hosting go?

00:59:04.000 --> 00:59:06.999
If the composing line gave spoilers,

00:59:07.000 --> 00:59:07.999
then...

00:59:08.000 --> 00:59:10.999
shouldn't the dance line

00:59:11.000 --> 00:59:11.999
give one too?

00:59:12.000 --> 00:59:14.999
Right. The dance line should spoil something.

00:59:15.000 --> 00:59:15.999
Yes.

00:59:16.000 --> 00:59:17.999
How about a concert spoiler?

00:59:18.000 --> 00:59:18.999
A concert spoiler?

00:59:19.000 --> 00:59:20.999
Something related to the concert?

00:59:21.000 --> 00:59:21.999
Yes.

00:59:22.000 --> 00:59:23.999
Okay.

00:59:24.000 --> 00:59:25.999
Honestly, isn't it more fun

00:59:26.000 --> 00:59:27.999
not to spoil it?

00:59:28.000 --> 00:59:29.999
You spoiled all your own parts.

00:59:30.000 --> 00:59:30.999
Wait.

00:59:31.000 --> 00:59:33.999
You can imagine so much

00:59:34.000 --> 00:59:36.999
from “matdamyeon.”

00:59:37.000 --> 00:59:40.999
Like what?

00:59:41.000 --> 00:59:42.999
Seriously.

00:59:43.000 --> 00:59:43.999
Okay.

00:59:44.000 --> 00:59:46.999
Ja... Give us a spoiler.

00:59:47.000 --> 00:59:49.999
Now that you demand one... [Laughs]

00:59:50.000 --> 00:59:50.999
Do something.

00:59:51.000 --> 00:59:51.999
Hurry.

00:59:52.000 --> 00:59:55.999
Which part of the concert?

00:59:56.000 --> 00:59:57.999
Then...

00:59:58.000 --> 00:59:58.999
Maybe this.

00:59:59.000 --> 00:59:59.999
Ah.

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:00.999
Oh.

01:00:01.000 --> 01:00:02.999
Ah.

01:00:03.000 --> 01:00:03.999
There are really many options.

01:00:04.000 --> 01:00:05.999
Can't we just show choreography?

01:00:06.000 --> 01:00:08.999
Choreography?

01:00:09.000 --> 01:00:10.999
Nobody knows the music anyway,

01:00:11.000 --> 01:00:11.999
so this much...

01:00:12.000 --> 01:00:12.999
I think everyone would recognize it.

01:00:13.000 --> 01:00:14.999
Really?

01:00:15.000 --> 01:00:16.999
Yes.

01:00:17.000 --> 01:00:19.999
Then this.

01:00:20.000 --> 01:00:22.999
Oh, that's too much.

01:00:23.000 --> 01:00:25.999
Hamin, that's a leak.

01:00:26.000 --> 01:00:28.999
A spoiler should go that far, hyung.

01:00:29.000 --> 01:00:29.999
It beats “matdamyeon.”

01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:30.999
“Matdamyeon.”

01:00:31.000 --> 01:00:31.999
That was good. [Laughs]

01:00:32.000 --> 01:00:33.999
Okay. This much is fine.

01:00:34.000 --> 01:00:36.999
At the concert,

01:00:37.000 --> 01:00:38.999
you'll see many more varied

01:00:39.000 --> 01:00:40.999
and new things.

01:00:41.000 --> 01:00:41.999
There's lots of fun stuff.

01:00:42.000 --> 01:00:43.999
Really, so much.

01:00:44.000 --> 01:00:44.999
PLLI.

01:00:45.000 --> 01:00:46.999
In my opinion,

01:00:47.000 --> 01:00:47.999
this concert

01:00:48.000 --> 01:00:50.999
may be our best yet.

01:00:51.000 --> 01:00:51.999
I agree.

01:00:52.000 --> 01:00:52.999
Yes.

01:00:53.000 --> 01:00:54.999
We've prepared better than ever.

01:00:55.000 --> 01:00:56.999
Right. And the next concert

01:00:57.000 --> 01:00:58.999
will be even better.

01:00:59.000 --> 01:01:00.999
We must keep surpassing ourselves.

01:01:01.000 --> 01:01:01.999
Each will be the best yet.

01:01:02.000 --> 01:01:05.999
But this concert carries

01:01:06.000 --> 01:01:07.999
a lot of pressure.

01:01:08.000 --> 01:01:09.999
We've worked so hard

01:01:10.000 --> 01:01:11.999
and prepared so much. [Clears throat]

01:01:12.000 --> 01:01:12.999
Yes.

01:01:13.000 --> 01:01:15.999
We really want to do well.

01:01:16.000 --> 01:01:16.999
I think I'll be very nervous.

01:01:17.000 --> 01:01:18.999
I understand.

01:01:19.000 --> 01:01:19.999
Great.

01:01:20.000 --> 01:01:20.999
Great.

01:01:21.000 --> 01:01:25.999
We'll work really hard

01:01:26.000 --> 01:01:27.999
with all our hearts.

01:01:28.000 --> 01:01:28.999
You're eagerly waiting.

01:01:29.000 --> 01:01:29.999
Yes.

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:30.999
Please wait just a little longer.

01:01:31.000 --> 01:01:33.999
Ja... Now, everyone,

01:01:34.000 --> 01:01:34.999
we have sad news.

01:01:35.000 --> 01:01:35.999
One thing.

01:01:36.000 --> 01:01:37.999
Suddenly? Sad news?

01:01:38.000 --> 01:01:40.999
We've been quite busy lately

01:01:41.000 --> 01:01:43.999
with filming

01:01:44.000 --> 01:01:44.999
and so much to prepare.

01:01:45.000 --> 01:01:45.999
[Snorts]

01:01:46.000 --> 01:01:48.999
We have a way

01:01:49.000 --> 01:01:49.999
to relieve that stress.

01:01:50.000 --> 01:01:52.999
But Bongus...

01:01:53.000 --> 01:01:54.999
Those two ideas don't connect.

01:01:55.000 --> 01:01:56.999
Hear how we relieve it first.

01:01:57.000 --> 01:01:58.999
You need to listen.

01:01:59.000 --> 01:02:00.999
I thought we'd move on.

01:02:01.000 --> 01:02:01.999
So...

01:02:02.000 --> 01:02:05.999
Ja... What's happening? [Laughs]

01:02:06.000 --> 01:02:07.999
Please continue.

01:02:08.000 --> 01:02:09.999
What's the sad news?

01:02:10.000 --> 01:02:10.999
Well...

01:02:11.000 --> 01:02:12.999
The sad news... [Laughs]

01:02:13.000 --> 01:02:14.999
What was it?

01:02:15.000 --> 01:02:16.999
Being busy recording and filming

01:02:17.000 --> 01:02:18.999
made me sad.

01:02:19.000 --> 01:02:20.999
Seeing one another struggle

01:02:21.000 --> 01:02:22.999
made me feel sad. [Laughs]

01:02:23.000 --> 01:02:24.999
That's what I wanted to say.

01:02:25.000 --> 01:02:26.999
But everyone,

01:02:27.000 --> 01:02:27.999
there's even sadder news.

01:02:28.000 --> 01:02:29.999
Even sadder news.

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:32.999
Know what it is? I ate a lot.

01:02:33.000 --> 01:02:34.999
It was one of the games we really enjoyed as kids,

01:02:35.000 --> 01:02:37.999
and we've played it a few times

01:02:38.000 --> 01:02:38.999
on PLAVE broadcasts too.

01:02:39.000 --> 01:02:39.999
We've played it before.

01:02:40.000 --> 01:02:42.999
We should've led with that.

01:02:43.000 --> 01:02:43.999
[Laughs] Anyway...

01:02:44.000 --> 01:02:44.999
The game Crazy Arcade...

01:02:45.000 --> 01:02:46.999
It's driving me crazy! Crazy—

01:02:47.000 --> 01:02:47.999
Ah...

01:02:48.000 --> 01:02:50.999
is shutting down its servers.

01:02:51.000 --> 01:02:51.999
Ah, Cra—

01:02:52.000 --> 01:02:52.999
Shutting...

01:02:53.000 --> 01:02:55.999
So before the servers shut down,

01:02:56.000 --> 01:02:57.999
we thought we'd properly enjoy it one last time.

01:02:58.000 --> 01:03:00.999
"Before the server server closes"?

01:03:01.000 --> 01:03:03.999
Before the servers close! [Laughs]

01:03:04.000 --> 01:03:04.999
Right.

01:03:05.000 --> 01:03:05.999
Ja... We thought it would be nice

01:03:06.000 --> 01:03:08.999
to enjoy it properly one last time,

01:03:09.000 --> 01:03:09.999
so we've prepared it for you.

01:03:10.000 --> 01:03:12.999
Ja... Okay. Now, let's head back

01:03:13.000 --> 01:03:14.999
to our hideout.

01:03:15.000 --> 01:03:15.999
How does that sound?

01:03:16.000 --> 01:03:16.999
Yes. Shall we all stand up?

01:03:17.000 --> 01:03:17.999
Ja...

01:03:18.000 --> 01:03:18.999
All right.

01:03:19.000 --> 01:03:19.999
Ja... When I say, "One, two, three"...

01:03:20.000 --> 01:03:23.999
What was that? "One, two"?

01:03:24.000 --> 01:03:24.999
One... [Laughs]

01:03:25.000 --> 01:03:26.999
One, two...

01:03:27.000 --> 01:03:27.999
Seriously. Two!

01:03:28.000 --> 01:03:29.999
I'm really in a "two" mood today.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:30.999
Today...

01:03:31.000 --> 01:03:33.999
It's a two kind of day! Two!

01:03:34.000 --> 01:03:34.999
Very good. [Laughs]

01:03:35.000 --> 01:03:37.999
Ja... On three, we'll move

01:03:38.000 --> 01:03:39.999
to the hideout.

01:03:40.000 --> 01:03:40.999
Ja... Let's do it together.

01:03:41.000 --> 01:03:43.999
One, two, three!

01:03:44.000 --> 01:03:45.999
Hey!

01:03:46.000 --> 01:03:46.999
Hey!

01:03:47.000 --> 01:03:49.999
And now we've moved.

01:03:50.000 --> 01:03:51.999
"We've moved"... [Laughs]

01:03:52.000 --> 01:03:54.999
Why did you need to explain that?

01:03:55.000 --> 01:03:55.999
I don't understand.

01:03:56.000 --> 01:03:58.999
I was just trying to say something. [Laughs]

01:03:59.000 --> 01:04:01.999
Get comfortable in your own positions.

01:04:02.000 --> 01:04:03.999
Ja... Everyone, imagine we're at a PC bang today.

01:04:04.000 --> 01:04:04.999
That's the mood.

01:04:05.000 --> 01:04:05.999
We've done this among ourselves before,

01:04:06.000 --> 01:04:08.999
so everyone can sit

01:04:09.000 --> 01:04:09.999
however they're most comfortable.

01:04:10.000 --> 01:04:10.999
You're trying so hard,

01:04:11.000 --> 01:04:12.999
it's starting to hurt me.

01:04:13.000 --> 01:04:14.999
You won't stop talking.

01:04:15.000 --> 01:04:15.999
He's explaining it very earnestly.

01:04:16.000 --> 01:04:16.999
Ja... So here we are.

01:04:17.000 --> 01:04:19.999
We're all seated at our stations, right?

01:04:20.000 --> 01:04:20.999
Ja... Can you see

01:04:21.000 --> 01:04:23.999
the screen now? Yes?

01:04:24.000 --> 01:04:24.999
What do you mean?

01:04:25.000 --> 01:04:25.999
Our screen.

01:04:26.000 --> 01:04:27.999
What does "Can you see the screen you see" mean?

01:04:28.000 --> 01:04:29.999
Can PLLI see our screen? [Laughs]

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:30.999
Can you see it?

01:04:31.000 --> 01:04:33.999
They say there are colors.

01:04:34.000 --> 01:04:34.999
There are colors.

01:04:35.000 --> 01:04:37.999
Can you see it? Answer us.

01:04:38.000 --> 01:04:38.999
I guess they can't.

01:04:39.000 --> 01:04:40.999
Oh, can't they?

01:04:41.000 --> 01:04:42.999
Now my heart hurts.

01:04:43.000 --> 01:04:44.999
Yes, because we've now

01:04:45.000 --> 01:04:47.999
entered the game. As you can see on screen,

01:04:48.000 --> 01:04:49.999
it's been such a long time since we played.

01:04:50.000 --> 01:04:50.999
If you look now,

01:04:51.000 --> 01:04:52.999
we're all in the room.

01:04:53.000 --> 01:04:53.999
Yes.

01:04:54.000 --> 01:04:55.999
Ja... Everyone— Why can I see mine?

01:04:56.000 --> 01:04:56.999
Wait.

01:04:57.000 --> 01:04:58.999
You were caught trying to equip a needle

01:04:59.000 --> 01:05:00.999
all by yourself. [Laughs]

01:05:01.000 --> 01:05:01.999
Hold on. Let's not play dirty.

01:05:02.000 --> 01:05:03.999
Okay, okay! I'll take them all off.

01:05:04.000 --> 01:05:04.999
All right.

01:05:05.000 --> 01:05:06.999
Let's all remove our items first.

01:05:07.000 --> 01:05:07.999
Okay, okay.

01:05:08.000 --> 01:05:09.999
What's my ID?

01:05:10.000 --> 01:05:12.999
Mine— Where did the items menu go?

01:05:13.000 --> 01:05:14.999
Here it is. Remove all your items.

01:05:15.000 --> 01:05:16.999
Ah.

01:05:17.000 --> 01:05:18.999
Ja, ja... Now that we've removed them all,

01:05:19.000 --> 01:05:20.999
choose your characters,

01:05:21.000 --> 01:05:23.999
and let's have fun playing.

01:05:24.000 --> 01:05:24.999
Yes.

01:05:25.000 --> 01:05:26.999
Ja... Let's get ready.

01:05:27.000 --> 01:05:28.999
Ja... We need to split into teams.

01:05:29.000 --> 01:05:30.999
I thought we were at Lotte World.

01:05:31.000 --> 01:05:32.999
Then what? Three against two? [Laughs]

01:05:33.000 --> 01:05:33.999
Shall we do three against two?

01:05:34.000 --> 01:05:36.999
Is this a team match? Ready?

01:05:37.000 --> 01:05:39.999
Ja... Ready, go!

01:05:40.000 --> 01:05:44.999
Ja... Who was it that climbed

01:05:45.000 --> 01:05:47.999
fifteen floors...? Oh, what?

01:05:48.000 --> 01:05:50.999
No way. Stop messing around.

01:05:51.000 --> 01:05:52.999
This is driving me crazy.

01:05:53.000 --> 01:05:54.999
Right. That's a bit much, isn't it?

01:05:55.000 --> 01:05:55.999
Yeah.

01:05:56.000 --> 01:05:57.999
Why did I just die?

01:05:58.000 --> 01:05:59.999
I don't know. Why didn't you save me?

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:00.999
Huh?

01:06:01.000 --> 01:06:01.999
Hey!

01:06:02.000 --> 01:06:03.999
Why didn't you save me? Eunho!

01:06:04.000 --> 01:06:04.999
Eunho!

01:06:05.000 --> 01:06:07.999
Eunho, I'm coming! I'm coming!

01:06:08.000 --> 01:06:08.999
Hurry!

01:06:09.000 --> 01:06:09.999
Ah!

01:06:10.000 --> 01:06:10.999
Great, hyung—

01:06:11.000 --> 01:06:12.999
Hyung, already? Why—

01:06:13.000 --> 01:06:16.999
Why can't I save you? I want to, but I can't!

01:06:17.000 --> 01:06:18.999
If you pick this up... [Coughs]

01:06:19.000 --> 01:06:23.999
Was that a bad item?

01:06:24.000 --> 01:06:25.999
Hey, hyung, look! Whoa, I nearly died!

01:06:26.000 --> 01:06:27.999
Wait! This is brutal.

01:06:28.000 --> 01:06:28.999
This is way too brutal.

01:06:29.000 --> 01:06:29.999
Seriously.

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:31.999
Okay, we might be able to win this.

01:06:32.000 --> 01:06:33.999
You guys are being merciless, seriously.

01:06:34.000 --> 01:06:34.999
Whoa...

01:06:35.000 --> 01:06:36.999
You're crafty, hyung. You need to dodge!

01:06:37.000 --> 01:06:37.999
You have to dodge it.

01:06:38.000 --> 01:06:40.999
I barely have any items.

01:06:41.000 --> 01:06:42.999
Hey!

01:06:43.000 --> 01:06:44.999
Okay! Got it. We won. Bye!

01:06:45.000 --> 01:06:45.999
Hide! I'm going.

01:06:46.000 --> 01:06:47.999
You won't die if you stay there.

01:06:48.000 --> 01:06:49.999
Hey! Give me an exit route!

01:06:50.000 --> 01:06:50.999
There isn't one. Stay there.

01:06:51.000 --> 01:06:52.999
This is how you do it!

01:06:53.000 --> 01:06:53.999
[Screams] This is how you do it!

01:06:54.000 --> 01:06:55.999
[Laughs] This is how you do it!

01:06:56.000 --> 01:06:57.999
This is how you do it!

01:06:58.000 --> 01:06:59.999
What are you doing?

01:07:00.000 --> 01:07:00.999
I picked this up. Did it come out?

01:07:01.000 --> 01:07:02.999
Oh, I wasn't supposed to pick it up.

01:07:03.000 --> 01:07:05.999
I only have two. What?

01:07:06.000 --> 01:07:07.999
This is insane. Wait!

01:07:08.000 --> 01:07:08.999
Come on! [Laughs]

01:07:09.000 --> 01:07:11.999
That's not fair. But if I go here...

01:07:12.000 --> 01:07:12.999
Then...

01:07:13.000 --> 01:07:13.999
What? No!

01:07:14.000 --> 01:07:15.999
Nice!

01:07:16.000 --> 01:07:16.999
Will it explode? What?

01:07:17.000 --> 01:07:18.999
How did you get across?

01:07:19.000 --> 01:07:19.999
I picked up this item. [Screams]

01:07:20.000 --> 01:07:22.999
Ja... This is a battle of pride now.

01:07:23.000 --> 01:07:23.999
I don't think the two of us can beat them.

01:07:24.000 --> 01:07:24.999
Not like this.

01:07:25.000 --> 01:07:25.999
Are you two on the same team?

01:07:26.000 --> 01:07:27.999
This balances it out.

01:07:28.000 --> 01:07:28.999
You're good, hyung.

01:07:29.000 --> 01:07:29.999
That was a mistake. Ja...

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:31.999
How about another try on this map?

01:07:32.000 --> 01:07:32.999
Want to go again?

01:07:33.000 --> 01:07:34.999
Let's go! But first...

01:07:35.000 --> 01:07:36.999
Ja... Before we ready up,

01:07:37.000 --> 01:07:39.999
get ready to win.

01:07:40.000 --> 01:07:46.999
Good.

01:07:47.000 --> 01:07:52.999
Getting the items first is the key.

01:07:53.000 --> 01:07:54.999
Seriously.

01:07:55.000 --> 01:07:58.999
Come on!

01:07:59.000 --> 01:08:01.999
Hardly any items are appearing.

01:08:02.000 --> 01:08:03.999
I got it! Whoa— I'm dead.

01:08:04.000 --> 01:08:04.999
Sorry, sorry, sorry!

01:08:05.000 --> 01:08:07.999
Sorry. Okay.

01:08:08.000 --> 01:08:09.999
I ran over there. Thanks.

01:08:10.000 --> 01:08:12.999
You can't see where I am, can you?

01:08:13.000 --> 01:08:18.999
Hello, tank.

01:08:19.000 --> 01:08:20.999
Oh dear.

01:08:21.000 --> 01:08:23.999
What's that? Why?

01:08:24.000 --> 01:08:25.999
I'll save you. Huh?

01:08:26.000 --> 01:08:28.999
What if I kill you?

01:08:29.000 --> 01:08:30.999
Yes, got it! Nice, it's mine.

01:08:31.000 --> 01:08:32.999
Bye-bye! Ah!

01:08:33.000 --> 01:08:34.999
Sorry.

01:08:35.000 --> 01:08:35.999
I...

01:08:36.000 --> 01:08:43.999
I only have one water balloon. This is crazy.

01:08:44.000 --> 01:08:45.999
Nice! Save me!

01:08:46.000 --> 01:08:48.999
Hey, I'll kill it. I'll detonate it.

01:08:49.000 --> 01:08:50.999
I set it off! I set it off!

01:08:51.000 --> 01:08:53.999
Guys! Hey, I died!

01:08:54.000 --> 01:08:54.999
Hurry!

01:08:55.000 --> 01:08:56.999
Hey, I— [Laughs]

01:08:57.000 --> 01:08:57.999
No! Okay.

01:08:58.000 --> 01:08:59.999
See? It doesn't work. One versus one versus one.

01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:02.999
A handicap match sounds good.

01:09:03.000 --> 01:09:03.999
Ja... We're live... [Clears throat]

01:09:04.000 --> 01:09:05.999
Should we put something on the line?

01:09:06.000 --> 01:09:06.999
Ja... Okay, now it's one-on-one.

01:09:07.000 --> 01:09:07.999
Ja... Hit Ready.

01:09:08.000 --> 01:09:09.999
Please hit Ready.

01:09:10.000 --> 01:09:11.999
Ja... Wow, listen to the gaming lingo.

01:09:12.000 --> 01:09:12.999
The team I'm on

01:09:13.000 --> 01:09:14.999
is definitely going to win.

01:09:15.000 --> 01:09:16.999
You're good.

01:09:17.000 --> 01:09:17.999
You mean you'll win because you're there?

01:09:18.000 --> 01:09:22.999
The green team is Yejun-hyung and me, Hamin.

01:09:23.000 --> 01:09:23.999
The other team is...

01:09:24.000 --> 01:09:25.999
Noah, No—

01:09:26.000 --> 01:09:27.999
Bamby. Yes, yes.

01:09:28.000 --> 01:09:28.999
Hamin knows how to play too.

01:09:29.000 --> 01:09:30.999
PLLI can decide who's best.

01:09:31.000 --> 01:09:36.999
Look at the finesse of taking one more.

01:09:37.000 --> 01:09:37.999
Seriously!

01:09:38.000 --> 01:09:39.999
How many times are you going to die?

01:09:40.000 --> 01:09:40.999
That's mine!

01:09:41.000 --> 01:09:42.999
I'm saving both of them right now.

01:09:43.000 --> 01:09:44.999
Seriously, I got him!

01:09:45.000 --> 01:09:46.999
I got him! How many times have you died?

01:09:47.000 --> 01:09:48.999
The items— How many times—

01:09:49.000 --> 01:09:51.999
[Laughs] Save me! Come up!

01:09:52.000 --> 01:09:52.999
Come up and save me!

01:09:53.000 --> 01:09:56.999
That was close. What are you doing?

01:09:57.000 --> 01:09:59.999
Hey! I have a strategy.

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:00.999
I do.

01:10:01.000 --> 01:10:03.999
I'm going with the Odysseus strategy.

01:10:04.000 --> 01:10:05.999
Hey!

01:10:06.000 --> 01:10:06.999
Good.

01:10:07.000 --> 01:10:08.999
Where's my Odysseus strategy, hyung?

01:10:09.000 --> 01:10:10.999
Hyung, I was inspired by it. Why won't— [Laughs]

01:10:11.000 --> 01:10:12.999
Wow, hyung, you didn't get trapped.

01:10:13.000 --> 01:10:14.999
Watch closely. This is my skill!

01:10:15.000 --> 01:10:15.999
The Odysseus strategy.

01:10:16.000 --> 01:10:16.999
How am I supposed to watch?

01:10:17.000 --> 01:10:18.999
Do you know what the Odysseus strategy is?

01:10:19.000 --> 01:10:21.999
Forget Odysseus and save me first!

01:10:22.000 --> 01:10:25.999
What are you doing?

01:10:26.000 --> 01:10:27.999
We can't all sacrifice ourselves for one person.

01:10:28.000 --> 01:10:29.999
Yes! We can't all sacrifice ourselves for one.

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:30.999
No!

01:10:31.000 --> 01:10:31.999
Ah...

01:10:32.000 --> 01:10:32.999
We can't all sacrifice ourselves for one.

01:10:33.000 --> 01:10:35.999
Right. Still, I got one kill.

01:10:36.000 --> 01:10:37.999
Nice.

01:10:38.000 --> 01:10:40.999
Okay, show us, Yejun-hyung. Nice!

01:10:41.000 --> 01:10:42.999
Okay. But Dudu is pretty good.

01:10:43.000 --> 01:10:43.999
I'll show you. I should save him.

01:10:44.000 --> 01:10:44.999
I have to.

01:10:45.000 --> 01:10:45.999
Eunho, what are you doing? Hurry!

01:10:46.000 --> 01:10:46.999
Eunho, what are you doing?

01:10:47.000 --> 01:10:47.999
Eunho, come across!

01:10:48.000 --> 01:10:49.999
Use Control to cross! Eunho!

01:10:50.000 --> 01:10:50.999
No, it's fine. Nice! [Laughs]

01:10:51.000 --> 01:10:52.999
[Laughs]

01:10:53.000 --> 01:10:54.999
What is this?

01:10:55.000 --> 01:10:57.999
No, it's okay. Hey!

01:10:58.000 --> 01:10:58.999
Okay.

01:10:59.000 --> 01:11:00.999
We won! We won!

01:11:01.000 --> 01:11:03.999
Nice!

01:11:04.000 --> 01:11:04.999
I shouldn't have died first.

01:11:05.000 --> 01:11:05.999
We lost.

01:11:06.000 --> 01:11:08.999
And I leveled up again.

01:11:09.000 --> 01:11:09.999
What? How?

01:11:10.000 --> 01:11:11.999
I have the most of those.

01:11:12.000 --> 01:11:13.999
Levels? Okay, now I'm playing seriously.

01:11:14.000 --> 01:11:16.999
Ja... Shall we?

01:11:17.000 --> 01:11:18.999
Ja... The winner gets to change the map.

01:11:19.000 --> 01:11:21.999
Let's go solo. Okay, free-for-all.

01:11:22.000 --> 01:11:22.999
Honestly, that was a warm-up.

01:11:23.000 --> 01:11:23.999
Let's determine the rankings.

01:11:24.000 --> 01:11:24.999
Okay. Here we go.

01:11:25.000 --> 01:11:27.999
Ja... The last match before the shutdown.

01:11:28.000 --> 01:11:29.999
If you lose here, the servers shut down,

01:11:30.000 --> 01:11:31.999
so there's no chance to redeem yourself.

01:11:32.000 --> 01:11:33.999
It ends here.

01:11:34.000 --> 01:11:34.999
We all need question marks for this.

01:11:35.000 --> 01:11:36.999
Seriously. Okay, okay.

01:11:37.000 --> 01:11:37.999
How do we set question marks?

01:11:38.000 --> 01:11:38.999
Switch it to individual.

01:11:39.000 --> 01:11:39.999
Question marks.

01:11:40.000 --> 01:11:41.999
You need to change the color too.

01:11:42.000 --> 01:11:42.999
Set it to your own color.

01:11:43.000 --> 01:11:45.999
Right, everyone use their own color.

01:11:46.000 --> 01:11:47.999
Okay, guys, let's go. Done.

01:11:48.000 --> 01:11:48.999
Go!

01:11:49.000 --> 01:11:50.999
Ja... Get ready. Later, after this,

01:11:51.000 --> 01:11:52.999
let's also play hide-and-seek.

01:11:53.000 --> 01:11:53.999
Get ready.

01:11:54.000 --> 01:11:54.999
The chameleon one.

01:11:55.000 --> 01:11:55.999
Want to try chameleon?

01:11:56.000 --> 01:11:56.999
Sounds good.

01:11:57.000 --> 01:11:58.999
I want to try that.

01:11:59.000 --> 01:11:59.999
Guys, our pride is on the line here.

01:12:00.000 --> 01:12:00.999
Seriously.

01:12:01.000 --> 01:12:03.999
Where am I? Okay.

01:12:04.000 --> 01:12:05.999
Ja... I'll show you my skills.

01:12:06.000 --> 01:12:06.999
I'm really going to prove myself here.

01:12:07.000 --> 01:12:07.999
You didn't know, did you?

01:12:08.000 --> 01:12:09.999
I'm a Crazy Arcade master.

01:12:10.000 --> 01:12:11.999
But this game is all luck.

01:12:12.000 --> 01:12:12.999
I'm playing purely by Crazy instincts.

01:12:13.000 --> 01:12:13.999
It's a game of luck.

01:12:14.000 --> 01:12:17.999
I'm serious! Pure luck—

01:12:18.000 --> 01:12:18.999
Idiot.

01:12:19.000 --> 01:12:20.999
It really is luck. Admit it.

01:12:21.000 --> 01:12:23.999
So you admit you're an idiot. Ow!

01:12:24.000 --> 01:12:25.999
Ja... CWK. [Laughs]

01:12:26.000 --> 01:12:29.999
Ja... We— I have two lives.

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:31.999
I died in such a ridiculous way.

01:12:32.000 --> 01:12:33.999
Ja... If you stay still, you'll get halfway there.

01:12:34.000 --> 01:12:35.999
That's one of Noah-hyung's famous sayings.

01:12:36.000 --> 01:12:37.999
Exactly, so I'll stay still. Damn it.

01:12:38.000 --> 01:12:38.999
You can't stay still.

01:12:39.000 --> 01:12:41.999
Does staying still get you halfway there?

01:12:42.000 --> 01:12:43.999
No one can do anything.

01:12:44.000 --> 01:12:46.999
If you stay there, next...

01:12:47.000 --> 01:12:48.999
you basically block the path. I need that.

01:12:49.000 --> 01:12:52.999
The moment I pick that up...

01:12:53.000 --> 01:12:54.999
Ah!

01:12:55.000 --> 01:12:56.999
So close. I should've trapped you right between them.

01:12:57.000 --> 01:12:58.999
I could've shown you my skill.

01:12:59.000 --> 01:13:02.999
A delicate touch. Delicate.

01:13:03.000 --> 01:13:03.999
A raw touch.

01:13:04.000 --> 01:13:04.999
Judgment is what matters.

01:13:05.000 --> 01:13:09.999
That was good, Yejun-hyung. Nice try.

01:13:10.000 --> 01:13:10.999
Don't underestimate them. They'll fight.

01:13:11.000 --> 01:13:11.999
They will.

01:13:12.000 --> 01:13:12.999
Right.

01:13:13.000 --> 01:13:13.999
Ja...

01:13:14.000 --> 01:13:14.999
There! Someone took the bait.

01:13:15.000 --> 01:13:15.999
Not very good, huh?

01:13:16.000 --> 01:13:16.999
Dead.

01:13:17.000 --> 01:13:17.999
Ja... Now, stay still.

01:13:18.000 --> 01:13:18.999
Is that all you picked up?

01:13:19.000 --> 01:13:20.999
Right. Eunho hasn't picked up

01:13:21.000 --> 01:13:24.999
anything. He's a light eater.

01:13:25.000 --> 01:13:26.999
Ja... Water balloons are flying in,

01:13:27.000 --> 01:13:28.999
but they don't stand a chance

01:13:29.000 --> 01:13:30.999
because there are so many obstacles.

01:13:31.000 --> 01:13:31.999
I took everything. Nothing left.

01:13:32.000 --> 01:13:33.999
Give me anything that's left.

01:13:34.000 --> 01:13:35.999
Ja... You can simply block the path

01:13:36.000 --> 01:13:38.999
like this.

01:13:39.000 --> 01:13:39.999
Just like this.

01:13:40.000 --> 01:13:40.999
I played well.

01:13:41.000 --> 01:13:41.999
Dudu is pretty good.

01:13:42.000 --> 01:13:44.999
I played well; the situation just didn't cooperate.

01:13:45.000 --> 01:13:46.999
That's all.

01:13:47.000 --> 01:13:48.999
I'll take one more item

01:13:49.000 --> 01:13:51.999
for a longer blast.

01:13:52.000 --> 01:13:52.999
They're coming this way.

01:13:53.000 --> 01:13:56.999
I— Hey!

01:13:57.000 --> 01:13:58.999
Ja... You always have to confuse them.

01:13:59.000 --> 01:14:00.999
The outcome is decided now.

01:14:01.000 --> 01:14:02.999
Ja... Here comes the Trojan Horse strategy.

01:14:03.000 --> 01:14:04.999
Ja... And Bamby has been knocked out.

01:14:05.000 --> 01:14:06.999
[Laughs]

01:14:07.000 --> 01:14:10.999
I messed up.

01:14:11.000 --> 01:14:14.999
Ja... Here.

01:14:15.000 --> 01:14:18.999
Hamin's Dudu is actually pretty good.

01:14:19.000 --> 01:14:19.999
Maybe that character's good. Right.

01:14:20.000 --> 01:14:21.999
Whoa, wait. What's that?

01:14:22.000 --> 01:14:23.999
What item is it? Did you pick it up?

01:14:24.000 --> 01:14:24.999
I picked it up earlier.

01:14:25.000 --> 01:14:26.999
This one.

01:14:27.000 --> 01:14:28.999
I got it. Hey, this round is void!

01:14:29.000 --> 01:14:29.999
But items do appear.

01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:30.999
They do.

01:14:31.000 --> 01:14:32.999
Even needles appear, Hamin.

01:14:33.000 --> 01:14:34.999
Ja... Okay, Hamin, that isn't supposed to appear.

01:14:35.000 --> 01:14:36.999
You have to press the white one.

01:14:37.000 --> 01:14:37.999
Why?

01:14:38.000 --> 01:14:38.999
The white one. Just a childhood habit.

01:14:39.000 --> 01:14:42.999
Let's not use items.

01:14:43.000 --> 01:14:44.999
PLLI can see everything.

01:14:45.000 --> 01:14:46.999
Let's replay this map. Okay.

01:14:47.000 --> 01:14:49.999
Okay, okay. You seem confident.

01:14:50.000 --> 01:14:51.999
Ja... Get ready, CK.

01:14:52.000 --> 01:14:52.999
I'm better on open maps,

01:14:53.000 --> 01:14:55.999
but I'll accommodate you guys.

01:14:56.000 --> 01:14:56.999
Ja...

01:14:57.000 --> 01:14:58.999
Seriously, don't use items. That's cheating.

01:14:59.000 --> 01:14:59.999
Let's not play dirty.

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:01.999
No items. Seriously, what's wrong with you?

01:15:02.000 --> 01:15:07.999
Why?

01:15:08.000 --> 01:15:11.999
Don't come over here already.

01:15:12.000 --> 01:15:13.999
That's mine! You stole it.

01:15:14.000 --> 01:15:14.999
Thanks.

01:15:15.000 --> 01:15:16.999
What's that egg?

01:15:17.000 --> 01:15:17.999
You took another one! [Laughs]

01:15:18.000 --> 01:15:19.999
Skates are the most important.

01:15:20.000 --> 01:15:22.999
Speed is everything.

01:15:23.000 --> 01:15:33.999
And the two-ball upgrade matters too.

01:15:34.000 --> 01:15:34.999
Why am I getting no items at all?

01:15:35.000 --> 01:15:49.999
There, I got one.

01:15:50.000 --> 01:15:51.999
One at a time...

01:15:52.000 --> 01:15:53.999
Shall we take it?

01:15:54.000 --> 01:15:54.999
[Laughs]

01:15:55.000 --> 01:15:57.999
What is this?

01:15:58.000 --> 01:15:59.999
What? What is this?

01:16:00.000 --> 01:16:01.999
Get Hamin! Now's the time!

01:16:02.000 --> 01:16:07.999
Get Hamin now!

01:16:08.000 --> 01:16:09.999
We got him!

01:16:10.000 --> 01:16:12.999
What? Did you pick something up?

01:16:13.000 --> 01:16:14.999
That's not fair. I didn't—

01:16:15.000 --> 01:16:16.999
That wasn't me! You picked up too many items.

01:16:17.000 --> 01:16:17.999
Way too many.

01:16:18.000 --> 01:16:18.999
Why do they only appear for you?

01:16:19.000 --> 01:16:20.999
I picked this one up.

01:16:21.000 --> 01:16:22.999
PLLI knows. They'll know.

01:16:23.000 --> 01:16:25.999
PLLI, tell us if you saw it.

01:16:26.000 --> 01:16:26.999
Tell us.

01:16:27.000 --> 01:16:27.999
Don't cover for him.

01:16:28.000 --> 01:16:29.999
You have to tell us.

01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:32.999
Tell us. I just picked this one up.

01:16:33.000 --> 01:16:34.999
This one was mine.

01:16:35.000 --> 01:16:36.999
This is infuriating.

01:16:37.000 --> 01:16:37.999
But after we split the areas evenly,

01:16:38.000 --> 01:16:39.999
I got hardly any items this time.

01:16:40.000 --> 01:16:40.999
I had the same-sized area.

01:16:41.000 --> 01:16:41.999
Then I'd lose because of the items.

01:16:42.000 --> 01:16:44.999
Wow.

01:16:45.000 --> 01:16:46.999
Those two are left again.

01:16:47.000 --> 01:16:48.999
Hamin did cheat a little,

01:16:49.000 --> 01:16:49.999
but we'd have to review it.

01:16:50.000 --> 01:16:51.999
We can't see it.

01:16:52.000 --> 01:16:54.999
He's good. PLLI says they didn't see

01:16:55.000 --> 01:16:55.999
the item appear.

01:16:56.000 --> 01:16:56.999
What? Why?

01:16:57.000 --> 01:16:57.999
They didn't see Hamin's item?

01:16:58.000 --> 01:16:58.999
You can tell from what he picked up.

01:16:59.000 --> 01:17:00.999
That's what they didn't see.

01:17:01.000 --> 01:17:02.999
They must've been watching you, hyung.

01:17:03.000 --> 01:17:04.999
Wow, you really cheated.

01:17:05.000 --> 01:17:06.999
Yejun-hyung is taking this game so seriously.

01:17:07.000 --> 01:17:08.999
You have to take it seriously! [Laughs]

01:17:09.000 --> 01:17:09.999
His eyes changed.

01:17:10.000 --> 01:17:12.999
This is a stage! A stage!

01:17:13.000 --> 01:17:13.999
Okay, trapped.

01:17:14.000 --> 01:17:15.999
Ah.

01:17:16.000 --> 01:17:16.999
But that's a bit—

01:17:17.000 --> 01:17:19.999
Hamin originally...

01:17:20.000 --> 01:17:21.999
It should've ended already,

01:17:22.000 --> 01:17:23.999
but the items were equipped in advance.

01:17:24.000 --> 01:17:24.999
Before the game started.

01:17:25.000 --> 01:17:25.999
I think so.

01:17:26.000 --> 01:17:26.999
A needle was equipped.

01:17:27.000 --> 01:17:28.999
Wait, I'll check.

01:17:29.000 --> 01:17:29.999
I'm telling you, there isn't one.

01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:31.999
My item is right here. What?

01:17:32.000 --> 01:17:33.999
What? Where is it?

01:17:34.000 --> 01:17:34.999
What's this?

01:17:35.000 --> 01:17:37.999
This sensor needle! Hey!

01:17:38.000 --> 01:17:38.999
Wow, seriously, you...

01:17:39.000 --> 01:17:40.999
Wait. Both of Hamin's first-place finishes

01:17:41.000 --> 01:17:41.999
are void.

01:17:42.000 --> 01:17:42.999
I didn't see it. Those count as zero.

01:17:43.000 --> 01:17:45.999
Hamin starts from zero now.

01:17:46.000 --> 01:17:47.999
That was meticulous. Fine, fine.

01:17:48.000 --> 01:17:51.999
Take it off! You play dirty! [Laughs]

01:17:52.000 --> 01:17:52.999
Yes! Hamin got reset to zero.

01:17:53.000 --> 01:17:54.999
Now I can start over. [Clears throat]

01:17:55.000 --> 01:17:55.999
That's how the game is played.

01:17:56.000 --> 01:17:56.999
Sure. [Laughs]

01:17:57.000 --> 01:17:57.999
You're awful.

01:17:58.000 --> 01:17:58.999
Get ready.

01:17:59.000 --> 01:18:00.999
Who's in the shop? Who is it?

01:18:01.000 --> 01:18:02.999
Going openly into the shop is a bit much.

01:18:03.000 --> 01:18:03.999
[Laughs] No—

01:18:04.000 --> 01:18:04.999
Can you see the shop items?

01:18:05.000 --> 01:18:05.999
Oh, really?

01:18:06.000 --> 01:18:06.999
They show up.

01:18:07.000 --> 01:18:07.999
I can see them here. Got it.

01:18:08.000 --> 01:18:08.999
Everyone, open My Page.

01:18:09.000 --> 01:18:11.999
Ja... Here— Where is My Page?

01:18:12.000 --> 01:18:12.999
