01:19:24.000 --> 01:19:24.999
This is where real skill shows.

01:19:25.000 --> 01:19:27.999
This is true skill.

01:19:28.000 --> 01:19:30.999
I'll win on this map.

01:19:31.000 --> 01:19:32.999
Everyone— I'm so weak. My water balloon...

01:19:33.000 --> 01:19:33.999
It's cute.

01:19:34.000 --> 01:19:38.999
