01:19:39.000 --> 01:19:39.999
Seriously.

01:19:40.000 --> 01:19:40.999
Hyung, your blast is way too long.

01:19:41.000 --> 01:19:41.999
Exactly. [Laughs]

01:19:42.000 --> 01:19:43.999
How am I supposed to win like this?

01:19:44.000 --> 01:19:45.999
Ah! Yeah!

01:19:46.000 --> 01:19:50.999
Yeah!

01:19:51.000 --> 01:19:52.999
I need to concentrate.

01:19:53.000 --> 01:19:54.999
This...

01:19:55.000 --> 01:19:58.999
Why does this catch me?

01:19:59.000 --> 01:20:04.999
Shall we go after Hamin?

01:20:05.000 --> 01:20:05.999
Wow, Dudu is really good.

01:20:06.000 --> 01:20:07.999
Seriously, that owl...

01:20:08.000 --> 01:20:09.999
That owl is ridiculous.

01:20:10.000 --> 01:20:10.999
My owl...

01:20:11.000 --> 01:20:12.999
Yejun-hyung is going to win this.

01:20:13.000 --> 01:20:14.999
