01:20:38.000 --> 01:20:39.999
Picking that up is cheating.

01:20:40.000 --> 01:20:40.999
Ah.

01:20:41.000 --> 01:20:43.999
He really took it. That's cheating.

01:20:44.000 --> 01:20:45.999
I'll have to go for Dudu.

01:20:46.000 --> 01:20:49.999
I have to get Dudu. Come here.

01:20:50.000 --> 01:20:52.999
