01:21:13.000 --> 01:21:13.999
Push it! Push it!

01:21:14.000 --> 01:21:14.999
Push!

01:21:15.000 --> 01:21:17.999
Ja... That was close. Push it!

01:21:18.000 --> 01:21:19.999
He's pushing very well.

01:21:20.000 --> 01:21:21.999
