01:21:24.000 --> 01:21:27.999
You're good. Seriously, so good.

01:21:28.000 --> 01:21:28.999
I'll admit that.

01:21:29.000 --> 01:21:29.999
Agreed. Make it fun.

01:21:30.000 --> 01:21:31.999
But I'm in silver-medal position.

01:21:32.000 --> 01:21:33.999
Guys, okay. Let's get Yejun first.

01:21:34.000 --> 01:21:34.999
Okay, okay.

01:21:35.000 --> 01:21:36.999
Let's do that. [Laughs] Strategy.

01:21:37.000 --> 01:21:37.999
Let's play strategically.

01:21:38.000 --> 01:21:38.999
Ja... Go right away.

01:21:39.000 --> 01:21:40.999
