01:21:47.000 --> 01:21:48.999
He's practically a pro.

01:21:49.000 --> 01:21:49.999
A pro, seriously.

01:21:50.000 --> 01:21:50.999
He's so good.

01:21:51.000 --> 01:21:51.999
Pro level.

01:21:52.000 --> 01:21:53.999
How do I ride this again?

01:21:54.000 --> 01:21:54.999
How did it work?

01:21:55.000 --> 01:21:56.999
Oh, you press it like this, guys.

01:21:57.000 --> 01:21:59.999
Seriously!

01:22:00.000 --> 01:22:02.999
Oh, this one...

01:22:03.000 --> 01:22:06.999
Two.

01:22:07.000 --> 01:22:10.999
Three, then four? Is that it?

01:22:11.000 --> 01:22:11.999
Wait, what is this? Do I have to do that

01:22:12.000 --> 01:22:13.999
