01:22:14.000 --> 01:22:15.999
That was close.

01:22:16.000 --> 01:22:17.999
What? What did you say? Really?

01:22:18.000 --> 01:22:19.999
Ja... What? Seriously? [Laughs]

01:22:20.000 --> 01:22:22.999
Wait— He's a pro! He's quietly

01:22:23.000 --> 01:22:23.999
