01:22:28.000 --> 01:22:29.999
You should've told us!

01:22:30.000 --> 01:22:31.999
I cried too.

01:22:32.000 --> 01:22:33.999
This is unbelievable. It's driving me crazy.

01:22:34.000 --> 01:22:34.999
I have no ranks left.

01:22:35.000 --> 01:22:35.999
Hey! [Laughs]

01:22:36.000 --> 01:22:36.999
I stepped on them in order too, hyung.

01:22:37.000 --> 01:22:38.999
Did I mix up the sequence?

01:22:39.000 --> 01:22:40.999
That can happen.

01:22:41.000 --> 01:22:43.999
Get ready. Okay.

01:22:44.000 --> 01:22:44.999
It starts, right? Ja... The real start.

01:22:45.000 --> 01:22:45.999
Now.

01:22:46.000 --> 01:22:48.999
Let's go. We have to get him.

01:22:49.000 --> 01:22:49.999
This is fun. Get Yejun—

01:22:50.000 --> 01:22:50.999
We have to get Yejun first.

01:22:51.000 --> 01:22:52.999
I'm too fat. Hey!

01:22:53.000 --> 01:22:54.999
Sorry.

01:22:55.000 --> 01:22:56.999
What?

01:22:57.000 --> 01:22:58.999
