01:22:59.000 --> 01:23:00.999
What? Why am I—

01:23:01.000 --> 01:23:03.999
What did you do?

01:23:04.000 --> 01:23:05.999
I died before I could do anything.

01:23:06.000 --> 01:23:08.999
From the very start? I nearly died.

01:23:09.000 --> 01:23:11.999
