01:23:17.000 --> 01:23:18.999
What happened?

01:23:19.000 --> 01:23:20.999
Ah.

01:23:21.000 --> 01:23:22.999
Yeah.

01:23:23.000 --> 01:23:24.999
That's strange.

01:23:25.000 --> 01:23:25.999
He really is a pro.

01:23:26.000 --> 01:23:26.999
My power is too weak.

01:23:27.000 --> 01:23:27.999
Yejun-hyung...

01:23:28.000 --> 01:23:29.999
Even refusing that spaceship must be a technique.

01:23:30.000 --> 01:23:30.999
