01:23:31.000 --> 01:23:32.999
No, he's deliberately not taking it.

01:23:33.000 --> 01:23:33.999
Exactly.

01:23:34.000 --> 01:23:34.999
He must have a plan. A strategy.

01:23:35.000 --> 01:23:37.999
If you place a water balloon here,

01:23:38.000 --> 01:23:38.999
