01:23:39.000 --> 01:23:39.999
Wow.

01:23:40.000 --> 01:23:41.999
You knew that all by yourself too?

01:23:42.000 --> 01:23:43.999
You're so unfair. Seriously.

01:23:44.000 --> 01:23:44.999
Unfair.

01:23:45.000 --> 01:23:46.999
Serves you right.

01:23:47.000 --> 01:23:47.999
