01:23:48.000 --> 01:23:49.999
Wow!

01:23:50.000 --> 01:23:51.999
What? No, I picked up a needle.

01:23:52.000 --> 01:23:52.999
What?

01:23:53.000 --> 01:23:54.999
No, seriously, you—

01:23:55.000 --> 01:23:57.999
It's ending anyway. Either way...

01:23:58.000 --> 01:23:59.999
[Laughs] He'll go down on his own now.

01:24:00.000 --> 01:24:00.999
Either way...

01:24:01.000 --> 01:24:01.999
Ah.

01:24:02.000 --> 01:24:02.999
Why are you so good?

01:24:03.000 --> 01:24:03.999
Seriously.

01:24:04.000 --> 01:24:04.999
Sorry, but I'm the silver medalist.

01:24:05.000 --> 01:24:05.999
We have to get Yejun first. [Laughs]

01:24:06.000 --> 01:24:07.999
Okay? Got it.

01:24:08.000 --> 01:24:10.999
Good. I'm first in level.

01:24:11.000 --> 01:24:12.999
Let's go. I've got the plan.

01:24:13.000 --> 01:24:13.999
I didn't know he'd be that good.

01:24:14.000 --> 01:24:14.999
He's seriously good.

01:24:15.000 --> 01:24:15.999
No, no. That was a mistake.

01:24:16.000 --> 01:24:18.999
Hey, this is my map! [Laughs]

01:24:19.000 --> 01:24:20.999
Guys, we have to get Yejun.

01:24:21.000 --> 01:24:21.999
Seriously.

01:24:22.000 --> 01:24:23.999
Don't let your guard down. Wow, Pirate Turtle!

01:24:24.000 --> 01:24:28.999
It's been so long.

01:24:29.000 --> 01:24:30.999
Bonggu, we're on the same side.

01:24:31.000 --> 01:24:32.999
Why did you steal mine? Okay.

01:24:33.000 --> 01:24:34.999
