01:24:39.000 --> 01:24:39.999
I'll save you!

01:24:40.000 --> 01:24:41.999
I'll save you!

01:24:42.000 --> 01:24:42.999
Ah!

01:24:43.000 --> 01:24:43.999
Oh, so that kills you.

01:24:44.000 --> 01:24:45.999
Sorry.

01:24:46.000 --> 01:24:49.999
Wow, that didn't work. Where did I go?

01:24:50.000 --> 01:24:51.999
Yejun-hyung was a bit scary just now.

01:24:52.000 --> 01:24:52.999
Scary.

01:24:53.000 --> 01:24:54.999
