01:25:13.000 --> 01:25:13.999
It's my first time on this map.

01:25:14.000 --> 01:25:15.999
He's so unfair. He takes the drops from my area.

01:25:16.000 --> 01:25:16.999
He just takes them.

01:25:17.000 --> 01:25:17.999
Honestly...

01:25:18.000 --> 01:25:18.999
Okay.

01:25:19.000 --> 01:25:19.999
Okay.

01:25:20.000 --> 01:25:20.999
Nice.

01:25:21.000 --> 01:25:23.999
I didn't take it because I thought it made you slow.

01:25:24.000 --> 01:25:24.999
