01:25:29.000 --> 01:25:29.999
Right.

01:25:30.000 --> 01:25:32.999
Look at it waddle. Cute.

01:25:33.000 --> 01:25:34.999
This is bad. Ja... With nothing, I'm finished.

01:25:35.000 --> 01:25:37.999
Right now...

01:25:38.000 --> 01:25:40.999
Eunho! We need to team up.

01:25:41.000 --> 01:25:41.999
You know what I mean? Don't kill me.

01:25:42.000 --> 01:25:42.999
You can't kill me.

01:25:43.000 --> 01:25:44.999
