01:25:45.000 --> 01:25:45.999
Get Yejun. Get Yejun.

01:25:46.000 --> 01:25:47.999
Get Yejun!

01:25:48.000 --> 01:25:48.999
Get Yejun, hyung.

01:25:49.000 --> 01:25:50.999
Hey, hyung!

01:25:51.000 --> 01:25:51.999
He's like a gnat. A gnat.

01:25:52.000 --> 01:25:52.999
Get Yejun! Yejun!

01:25:53.000 --> 01:25:54.999
Yejun!

01:25:55.000 --> 01:25:55.999
How are we supposed to catch him?

01:25:56.000 --> 01:25:57.999
Oh, I survived. We've simply lost.

01:25:58.000 --> 01:25:58.999
No.

01:25:59.000 --> 01:26:00.999
That hyung is so good.

01:26:01.000 --> 01:26:02.999
Give it here.

01:26:03.000 --> 01:26:03.999
Give it to me.

01:26:04.000 --> 01:26:04.999
He's taking that item anyway.

01:26:05.000 --> 01:26:06.999
Wait. He took it! I saw it.

01:26:07.000 --> 01:26:07.999
I saw it.

01:26:08.000 --> 01:26:11.999
We have to get Yejun. Wow!

01:26:12.000 --> 01:26:15.999
I said we have to get Yejun!

01:26:16.000 --> 01:26:17.999
How much does Yejun have? It was a blind spot.

01:26:18.000 --> 01:26:18.999
A blind spot...

01:26:19.000 --> 01:26:20.999
I picked up a needle. You saw it, right?

01:26:21.000 --> 01:26:23.999
PLLI saw it.

01:26:24.000 --> 01:26:25.999
Eunho!

01:26:26.000 --> 01:26:29.999
You take the top; I'll take the bottom. Okay.

01:26:30.000 --> 01:26:31.999
Noah-hyung! You're in danger!

01:26:32.000 --> 01:26:33.999
