01:26:46.000 --> 01:26:47.999
Ja... A breathtaking duel unfolds.

01:26:48.000 --> 01:26:50.999
You need to take all the items too.

01:26:51.000 --> 01:26:52.999
If you place it there, it blocks the path.

01:26:53.000 --> 01:26:54.999
Amazing.

01:26:55.000 --> 01:26:56.999
