01:27:03.000 --> 01:27:04.999
I didn't do anything. You guys died on your own.

01:27:05.000 --> 01:27:07.999
[Laughs]

01:27:08.000 --> 01:27:08.999
They died.

01:27:09.000 --> 01:27:09.999
Want to see my real skill?

01:27:10.000 --> 01:27:12.999
Okay, okay. Your true skill.

01:27:13.000 --> 01:27:14.999
Hyung is no match— Oh, he's in the shop.

01:27:15.000 --> 01:27:15.999
