01:27:16.000 --> 01:27:16.999
Come out.

01:27:17.000 --> 01:27:17.999
Hey, I like window-shopping.

01:27:18.000 --> 01:27:19.999
Guys, we really have to get him.

01:27:20.000 --> 01:27:20.999
