01:27:23.000 --> 01:27:25.999
Let's go to the shop.

01:27:26.000 --> 01:27:27.999
Don't equip anything.

01:27:28.000 --> 01:27:28.999
Seriously, be fair.

01:27:29.000 --> 01:27:30.999
Fine, fine.

01:27:31.000 --> 01:27:34.999
Let's go.

01:27:35.000 --> 01:27:35.999
Okay. This is my map.

01:27:36.000 --> 01:27:37.999
Space...

01:27:38.000 --> 01:27:40.999
Let's take this all the way.

01:27:41.000 --> 01:27:42.999
Dao! More water! My favorite...

01:27:43.000 --> 01:27:44.999
The one I like most.

01:27:45.000 --> 01:27:52.999
I've never played this one.

01:27:53.000 --> 01:27:54.999
Wait...

01:27:55.000 --> 01:27:56.999
What? What is it?

01:27:57.000 --> 01:28:00.999
Get away! Okay, I understand.

01:28:01.000 --> 01:28:01.999
Wow, what is this?

01:28:02.000 --> 01:28:03.999
Okay, I mustn't go in there.

01:28:04.000 --> 01:28:05.999
I'm coming out...

01:28:06.000 --> 01:28:07.999
What is this?

01:28:08.000 --> 01:28:09.999
Guys, wait! I'm going to die unfairly.

01:28:10.000 --> 01:28:10.999
No!

01:28:11.000 --> 01:28:12.999
Whoa!

01:28:13.000 --> 01:28:14.999
Hey, this makes it interesting. You never know.

01:28:15.000 --> 01:28:15.999
You never know.

01:28:16.000 --> 01:28:17.999
You really don't. If you had placed it here,

01:28:18.000 --> 01:28:19.999
that would've been true finesse. This is tiny!

01:28:20.000 --> 01:28:20.999
I did so well. Watch the timing.

01:28:21.000 --> 01:28:23.999
Ah.

01:28:24.000 --> 01:28:27.999
Dodge it!

01:28:28.000 --> 01:28:31.999
You just need to calculate it properly.

01:28:32.000 --> 01:28:32.999
There's nothing.

01:28:33.000 --> 01:28:33.999
[Screams]

01:28:34.000 --> 01:28:36.999
That was insane! So good!

01:28:37.000 --> 01:28:38.999
I'm breaking out in hives! I killed myself.

01:28:39.000 --> 01:28:39.999
That was my own doing.

01:28:40.000 --> 01:28:40.999
Hives!

01:28:41.000 --> 01:28:41.999
Yejun-hyung didn't kill me.

01:28:42.000 --> 01:28:44.999
I killed myself.

01:28:45.000 --> 01:28:45.999
Wow.

01:28:46.000 --> 01:28:48.999
But I'm the only silver medalist, sorry.

01:28:49.000 --> 01:28:49.999
[Laughs]

01:28:50.000 --> 01:28:50.999
Stop bragging and try to get him.

01:28:51.000 --> 01:28:51.999
Go on.

01:28:52.000 --> 01:28:53.999
Seriously, do it. Let's not just talk.

01:28:54.000 --> 01:28:54.999
Then ask me, hyung.

01:28:55.000 --> 01:28:55.999
I'm asking you.

01:28:56.000 --> 01:28:56.999
Okay, okay.

01:28:57.000 --> 01:28:58.999
Get Yejun first. Got it.

01:28:59.000 --> 01:29:01.999
Let's work together.

01:29:02.000 --> 01:29:02.999
Wow, seriously.

01:29:03.000 --> 01:29:04.999
Wait. Pirate!

01:29:05.000 --> 01:29:06.999
Come on, that's not fair.

01:29:07.000 --> 01:29:09.999
It is Pirate. This is truly my map.

01:29:10.000 --> 01:29:11.999
I fly on Pirate maps. Oh, a turtle.

01:29:12.000 --> 01:29:12.999
Yeah.

01:29:13.000 --> 01:29:16.999
What is this?

01:29:17.000 --> 01:29:19.999
There are no items. Are you scared of me?

01:29:20.000 --> 01:29:20.999
So fast. Okay, of course I'm scared.

01:29:21.000 --> 01:29:22.999
We might get him this time.

01:29:23.000 --> 01:29:23.999
You punk.

01:29:24.000 --> 01:29:24.999
No, let's not fight among ourselves.

01:29:25.000 --> 01:29:29.999
Okay— Don't do that to me.

01:29:30.000 --> 01:29:32.999
Eunho, why are you trying to kill me?

01:29:33.000 --> 01:29:34.999
We agreed to get Dudu.

01:29:35.000 --> 01:29:35.999
Hyung, that's not it. I'm all done.

01:29:36.000 --> 01:29:36.999
It's over for me.

01:29:37.000 --> 01:29:39.999
Don't use the slow one.

01:29:40.000 --> 01:29:41.999
Sorry, Hamin. Sorry.

01:29:42.000 --> 01:29:42.999
Okay, it's fine.

01:29:43.000 --> 01:29:43.999
Our target is Nam Yejun.

01:29:44.000 --> 01:29:46.999
Get it together.

01:29:47.000 --> 01:29:47.999
I'm focused now.

01:29:48.000 --> 01:29:49.999
Get Nam Yejun. Yes.

01:29:50.000 --> 01:29:51.999
You took all the items, right?

01:29:52.000 --> 01:29:52.999
Dudu, seriously...

01:29:53.000 --> 01:29:54.999
Okay, mine.

01:29:55.000 --> 01:29:56.999
I'm too weak right now. Okay.

01:29:57.000 --> 01:30:00.999
Now's the time!

01:30:01.000 --> 01:30:01.999
[Laughs]

01:30:02.000 --> 01:30:04.999
[Screams]

01:30:05.000 --> 01:30:07.999
Okay, got him! I should've asked you, hyung.

01:30:08.000 --> 01:30:08.999
The game...

01:30:09.000 --> 01:30:09.999
got better. [Laughs]

01:30:10.000 --> 01:30:10.999
Pirate.

01:30:11.000 --> 01:30:12.999
It's Pirate!

01:30:13.000 --> 01:30:15.999
Pirate is so fast. I—

01:30:16.000 --> 01:30:16.999
[Laughs] I died.

01:30:17.000 --> 01:30:18.999
Nice, nice.

01:30:19.000 --> 01:30:21.999
I predicted you'd come up in advance,

01:30:22.000 --> 01:30:23.999
so I placed this.

01:30:24.000 --> 01:30:26.999
Like this. This kind of move.

01:30:27.000 --> 01:30:29.999
I'm the Pirate! Nice.

01:30:30.000 --> 01:30:34.999
You do get hit while passing like that.

01:30:35.000 --> 01:30:37.999
That slow turtle punk.

01:30:38.000 --> 01:30:39.999
Wait.

01:30:40.000 --> 01:30:40.999
Nice.

01:30:41.000 --> 01:30:41.999
Bonggu got hit once. Why didn't he die?

01:30:42.000 --> 01:30:43.999
What was that? Did you equip an item?

01:30:44.000 --> 01:30:46.999
No, I didn't. Sorry.

01:30:47.000 --> 01:30:48.999
There isn't one. Sorry. Hamin won.

01:30:49.000 --> 01:30:50.999
Hamin won this one.

01:30:51.000 --> 01:30:52.999
Ja... He died so anticlimactically. Now, a miraculous

01:30:53.000 --> 01:30:55.999
comeback story could happen here.

01:30:56.000 --> 01:30:57.999
Eunho has no items and is weak right now.

01:30:58.000 --> 01:30:59.999
This is a chance to look good for PLLI.

01:31:00.000 --> 01:31:00.999
Even so...

01:31:01.000 --> 01:31:04.999
No, I picked up this needle.

01:31:05.000 --> 01:31:06.999
Needles shouldn't appear here. [Laughs]

01:31:07.000 --> 01:31:08.999
I am saving an item.

01:31:09.000 --> 01:31:09.999
Oh, really?

01:31:10.000 --> 01:31:10.999
I just used it.

01:31:11.000 --> 01:31:12.999
Oh, that's what happened.

01:31:13.000 --> 01:31:18.999
Ja... Right now, Eunho is the cheater.

01:31:19.000 --> 01:31:20.999
Ja... How should we finish? Shall we make it cool?

01:31:21.000 --> 01:31:23.999
Who will end this game?

01:31:24.000 --> 01:31:29.999
How will the Odyssey story end?

01:31:30.000 --> 01:31:32.999
Who is Odysseus here?

01:31:33.000 --> 01:31:34.999
This will end now. Sorry.

01:31:35.000 --> 01:31:35.999
Here's how it ends.

01:31:36.000 --> 01:31:36.999
Like this.

01:31:37.000 --> 01:31:37.999
Like this.

01:31:38.000 --> 01:31:39.999
This is how it ends.

01:31:40.000 --> 01:31:41.999
I have a habit of remembering

01:31:42.000 --> 01:31:43.999
every spot where I placed a water balloon.

01:31:44.000 --> 01:31:45.999
Okay, got it.

01:31:46.000 --> 01:31:48.999
Oh dear, Eunho.

01:31:49.000 --> 01:31:51.999
Good. You've improved in the meantime.

01:31:52.000 --> 01:31:52.999
If you do that, what will you do?

01:31:53.000 --> 01:31:53.999
What are you going to do?

01:31:54.000 --> 01:31:56.999
With a delayed blast like this.

01:31:57.000 --> 01:32:00.999
I'll push too. This could make it a draw.

01:32:01.000 --> 01:32:02.999
This isn't going to work. [Laughs]

01:32:03.000 --> 01:32:04.999
Wow! How did you kill him?

01:32:05.000 --> 01:32:06.999
No, this can't happen. Not between us.

01:32:07.000 --> 01:32:07.999
It's a draw.

01:32:08.000 --> 01:32:08.999
Exactly. So close.

01:32:09.000 --> 01:32:10.999
How did you get that hyung?

01:32:11.000 --> 01:32:11.999
Without that needle,

01:32:12.000 --> 01:32:13.999
I would've won. [Laughs]

01:32:14.000 --> 01:32:14.999
Ja...

01:32:15.000 --> 01:32:16.999
Remove the needle. I picked it up.

01:32:17.000 --> 01:32:19.999
This whole round is void, right? Void.

01:32:20.000 --> 01:32:21.999
I didn't equip a needle. See? There isn't one.

01:32:22.000 --> 01:32:24.999
Wait, I'm dead last.

01:32:25.000 --> 01:32:25.999
Should we skip that mode?

01:32:26.000 --> 01:32:26.999
Yes.

01:32:27.000 --> 01:32:27.999
Wait.

01:32:28.000 --> 01:32:28.999
What mode?

01:32:29.000 --> 01:32:29.999
That one? No, never mind.

01:32:30.000 --> 01:32:31.999
I'm in last place right now.

01:32:32.000 --> 01:32:32.999
Ja... Wow. Here's the mid-game score:

01:32:33.000 --> 01:32:35.999
Yejun, 27; Noah...

01:32:36.000 --> 01:32:36.999
9;

01:32:37.000 --> 01:32:37.999
Bamby...

01:32:38.000 --> 01:32:40.999
10; Eunho, 15; Hamin, 14.

01:32:41.000 --> 01:32:41.999
Hey!

01:32:42.000 --> 01:32:44.999
I'm above Hamin.

01:32:45.000 --> 01:32:45.999
Why am I second?

01:32:46.000 --> 01:32:47.999
Okay, this really is my map.

01:32:48.000 --> 01:32:50.999
I'm second? That's hilarious.

01:32:51.000 --> 01:32:51.999
My—

01:32:52.000 --> 01:32:52.999
Wait, why do I keep getting

01:32:53.000 --> 01:32:56.999
items like this? Seriously.

01:32:57.000 --> 01:32:58.999
Sorry, but it's mine. Great.

01:32:59.000 --> 01:33:01.999
Winning with an item like that makes a true master.

01:33:02.000 --> 01:33:04.999
Today... [Laughs]

01:33:05.000 --> 01:33:05.999
You look ready to use it immediately.

01:33:06.000 --> 01:33:06.999
Okay.

01:33:07.000 --> 01:33:08.999
What? You used a needle! [Laughs]

01:33:09.000 --> 01:33:11.999
I picked it up before using it.

01:33:12.000 --> 01:33:16.999
Hey...

01:33:17.000 --> 01:33:18.999
What does the backpack do?

01:33:19.000 --> 01:33:20.999
It's a backpack. Give me strength.

01:33:21.000 --> 01:33:22.999
I can't pick it up. Wait—

01:33:23.000 --> 01:33:23.999
Oh, I couldn't take that item.

01:33:24.000 --> 01:33:24.999
You can't.

01:33:25.000 --> 01:33:26.999
Hyung, are you trying to overeat?

01:33:27.000 --> 01:33:28.999
I can't do anything like this.

01:33:29.000 --> 01:33:30.999
This is bad. The items— Wait.

01:33:31.000 --> 01:33:31.999
Hyung, you can get off that.

01:33:32.000 --> 01:33:34.999
It won't let me off. Win it for us here. [Laughs]

01:33:35.000 --> 01:33:36.999
It won't let me off. Win it for us.

01:33:37.000 --> 01:33:38.999
Then I'll do it.

01:33:39.000 --> 01:33:41.999
Goodbye.

01:33:42.000 --> 01:33:43.999
Pirate Turtle.

01:33:44.000 --> 01:33:44.999
Pirate Turtle is good. What am I?

01:33:45.000 --> 01:33:46.999
[Laughs] What were you guys just doing?

01:33:47.000 --> 01:33:48.999
What is Pirate Turtle? Wait.

01:33:49.000 --> 01:33:50.999
Okay, inline skates.

01:33:51.000 --> 01:33:52.999
Wow! Okay, got one. [Screams]

01:33:53.000 --> 01:33:56.999
What effect does this backpack have?

01:33:57.000 --> 01:33:57.999
Hyung, what does the backpack do? Look.

01:33:58.000 --> 01:33:59.999
Eunho, wait. You keep surviving.

01:34:00.000 --> 01:34:01.999
You really do.

01:34:02.000 --> 01:34:03.999
Exactly. Let's get Eunho— No,

01:34:04.000 --> 01:34:04.999
let's get Yejun.

01:34:05.000 --> 01:34:05.999
That web slows you down.

01:34:06.000 --> 01:34:06.999
Ah.

01:34:07.000 --> 01:34:07.999
Let's get Yejun.

01:34:08.000 --> 01:34:09.999
Okay, get Yejun first.

01:34:10.000 --> 01:34:11.999
Hyung, since you're in a spaceship,

01:34:12.000 --> 01:34:13.999
you do it. I'm already doing it.

01:34:14.000 --> 01:34:16.999
No, hyung— No! [Laughs]

01:34:17.000 --> 01:34:17.999
Oh!

01:34:18.000 --> 01:34:18.999
Everyone stop right there!

01:34:19.000 --> 01:34:21.999
No, the Pirate—

01:34:22.000 --> 01:34:23.999
Hyung, watch out for the spiderweb.

01:34:24.000 --> 01:34:24.999
Okay, but I...

01:34:25.000 --> 01:34:26.999
What does that backpack do?

01:34:27.000 --> 01:34:29.999
The backpack? I have no items at all.

01:34:30.000 --> 01:34:31.999
It's over. We won!

01:34:32.000 --> 01:34:33.999
What, hyung? You must be great at collecting items.

01:34:34.000 --> 01:34:34.999
Seriously.

01:34:35.000 --> 01:34:37.999
Only he has that many items.

01:34:38.000 --> 01:34:38.999
Hyung, where did you buy that item?

01:34:39.000 --> 01:34:40.999
No, I just picked up a lot.

01:34:41.000 --> 01:34:42.999
It came fully equipped.

01:34:43.000 --> 01:34:45.999
Why did I come out?

01:34:46.000 --> 01:34:47.999
You weren't going to buy items, were you?

01:34:48.000 --> 01:34:52.999
No! You guys are too much.

01:34:53.000 --> 01:34:53.999
My water...

01:34:54.000 --> 01:34:54.999
Thanks.

01:34:55.000 --> 01:34:56.999
Wait, you're taking all those items?

01:34:57.000 --> 01:34:58.999
Every one of them?

01:34:59.000 --> 01:35:02.999
Wow! My water stream is so short.

01:35:03.000 --> 01:35:03.999
Way too short.

01:35:04.000 --> 01:35:06.999
Exactly. If it were longer, I'd have caught him.

01:35:07.000 --> 01:35:11.999
Let's see. Good.

01:35:12.000 --> 01:35:14.999
Yejun-hyung is as good as ever.

01:35:15.000 --> 01:35:15.999
Eunho, hurry and get him!

01:35:16.000 --> 01:35:16.999
Get him!

01:35:17.000 --> 01:35:18.999
Get him, hyung!

01:35:19.000 --> 01:35:20.999
Careful.

01:35:21.000 --> 01:35:22.999
He picked up another one.

01:35:23.000 --> 01:35:29.999
He keeps taking items.

01:35:30.000 --> 01:35:30.999
It's okay. Kill him and we get it all.

01:35:31.000 --> 01:35:34.999
He has a hundred of them.

01:35:35.000 --> 01:35:39.999
Ja... Eight seconds left, so it's heading for a draw.

01:35:40.000 --> 01:35:41.999
Fight! Come on, fight!

01:35:42.000 --> 01:35:43.999
Let's try it.

01:35:44.000 --> 01:35:45.999
This one...

01:35:46.000 --> 01:35:47.999
Hey!

01:35:48.000 --> 01:35:48.999
It's a tie.

01:35:49.000 --> 01:35:51.999
[Sighs]

01:35:52.000 --> 01:35:53.999
You're terrible. Let's do one last round

01:35:54.000 --> 01:35:55.999
and then switch modes.

01:35:56.000 --> 01:35:56.999
Okay.

01:35:57.000 --> 01:35:58.999
Fine, idiot.

01:35:59.000 --> 01:36:00.999
Then remove everything and play here.

01:36:01.000 --> 01:36:05.999
Whoever wins this one takes it all.

01:36:06.000 --> 01:36:08.999
Fine. I said fine, idiot.

01:36:09.000 --> 01:36:10.999
Okay.

01:36:11.000 --> 01:36:11.999
You're really dudu-ing.

01:36:12.000 --> 01:36:12.999
Okay.

01:36:13.000 --> 01:36:14.999
Idiots, I'm going to win.

01:36:15.000 --> 01:36:16.999
If you win here, it's over.

01:36:17.000 --> 01:36:17.999
Seriously, get Dudu this time. [Laughs]

01:36:18.000 --> 01:36:18.999
I'm Pirate!

01:36:19.000 --> 01:36:19.999
I'm Pirate.

01:36:20.000 --> 01:36:21.999
That's too much. Restart.

01:36:22.000 --> 01:36:22.999
Ah.

01:36:23.000 --> 01:36:24.999
That's cheating.

01:36:25.000 --> 01:36:26.999
Pirate actually came up. Wow.

01:36:27.000 --> 01:36:29.999
Sorry, I'm really slow and heavy right now.

01:36:30.000 --> 01:36:32.999
Hamin, could you stay away from me?

01:36:33.000 --> 01:36:33.999
You're scared, honestly.

01:36:34.000 --> 01:36:36.999
Yeah. Sorry.

01:36:37.000 --> 01:36:38.999
My speed is frighteningly low.

01:36:39.000 --> 01:36:39.999
I have nothing. This is bad.

01:36:40.000 --> 01:36:41.999
Me neither.

01:36:42.000 --> 01:36:44.999
Guys— Yejun-hyung, give me some.

01:36:45.000 --> 01:36:46.999
I have absolutely nothing.

01:36:47.000 --> 01:36:48.999
Yejun, don't come near me! [Laughs]

01:36:49.000 --> 01:36:52.999
Don't come, Dudu!

01:36:53.000 --> 01:36:54.999
Dudu is coming. Wow, I'm so weak.

01:36:55.000 --> 01:36:55.999
Get Dudu!

01:36:56.000 --> 01:36:56.999
Get Dudu!

01:36:57.000 --> 01:36:57.999
Get Dudu!

01:36:58.000 --> 01:36:58.999
Hurry and get him!

01:36:59.000 --> 01:36:59.999
What?

01:37:00.000 --> 01:37:00.999
Wait, I'm here—

01:37:01.000 --> 01:37:02.999
No, what I picked up...

01:37:03.000 --> 01:37:03.999
Hurry, get Dudu!

01:37:04.000 --> 01:37:05.999
Get Dudu! [Laughs] You're trying to hit me, aren't you?

01:37:06.000 --> 01:37:06.999
I said get Dudu!

01:37:07.000 --> 01:37:07.999
Hurry!

01:37:08.000 --> 01:37:09.999
Get Dudu quickly!

01:37:10.000 --> 01:37:11.999
I can't. I'm too weak.

01:37:12.000 --> 01:37:12.999
I'm too weak too.

01:37:13.000 --> 01:37:13.999
Get Dudu again, guys! [Laughs]

01:37:14.000 --> 01:37:15.999
Give me one chance. Please.

01:37:16.000 --> 01:37:19.999
Just let me through once.

01:37:20.000 --> 01:37:20.999
[Clears throat and laughs]

01:37:21.000 --> 01:37:23.999
Ah.

01:37:24.000 --> 01:37:28.999
[Laughs] Wow.

01:37:29.000 --> 01:37:30.999
We're getting Dudu.

01:37:31.000 --> 01:37:33.999
We're getting Dudu.

01:37:34.000 --> 01:37:35.999
I'll sit this one out.

01:37:36.000 --> 01:37:36.999
Got Dudu! [Laughs]

01:37:37.000 --> 01:37:37.999
We got Dudu.

01:37:38.000 --> 01:37:38.999
Here—

01:37:39.000 --> 01:37:40.999
Hey!

01:37:41.000 --> 01:37:43.999
We got Dudu!

01:37:44.000 --> 01:37:44.999
Dudu became a ghost. What?

01:37:45.000 --> 01:37:45.999
He respawned.

01:37:46.000 --> 01:37:46.999
Guys, right now...

01:37:47.000 --> 01:37:51.999
I have an item.

01:37:52.000 --> 01:37:52.999
Come to me and take it.

01:37:53.000 --> 01:37:58.999
It makes you faster.

01:37:59.000 --> 01:38:01.999
Okay, get Hamin. We're getting Hamin.

01:38:02.000 --> 01:38:03.999
Hamin! We're getting Hamin.

01:38:04.000 --> 01:38:07.999
Wait— You almost got me.

01:38:08.000 --> 01:38:08.999
I'll throw the item.

01:38:09.000 --> 01:38:09.999
Hamin!

01:38:10.000 --> 01:38:12.999
I'll throw another. Take this.

01:38:13.000 --> 01:38:15.999
What happens if you run into those?

01:38:16.000 --> 01:38:19.999
You can't.

01:38:20.000 --> 01:38:21.999
The item...

01:38:22.000 --> 01:38:25.999
What's this?

01:38:26.000 --> 01:38:27.999
What's this drill? How do you use it?

01:38:28.000 --> 01:38:28.999
So tense.

01:38:29.000 --> 01:38:30.999
Huh? The drill— Wait.

01:38:31.000 --> 01:38:33.999
Oh, the drill effect.

01:38:34.000 --> 01:38:34.999
Okay. I'm satisfied with third place.

01:38:35.000 --> 01:38:35.999
What? Eunho again?

01:38:36.000 --> 01:38:38.999
No. First place is all that matters.

01:38:39.000 --> 01:38:40.999
Right, only first. Do you die if a ghost touches you?

01:38:41.000 --> 01:38:42.999
Do you?

01:38:43.000 --> 01:38:43.999
You don't?

01:38:44.000 --> 01:38:45.999
But here...

01:38:46.000 --> 01:38:46.999
I dodged for nothing, thinking I was dead,

01:38:47.000 --> 01:38:47.999
and died too.

